# Build context for the root `Dockerfile` (the web app). It builds from the
# REPOSITORY ROOT so pnpm can resolve `workspace:*`; everything not excluded
# here is uploaded to the builder on every deploy.
#
# Keep every package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`
# compares the lockfile against every workspace member's manifest.

**/node_modules

# Build output and caches
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
**/.vinxi
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# The Python model API ships its own image (apps/ml/Dockerfile). Its
# package.json stays for the frozen lockfile.
apps/ml/*
!apps/ml/package.json

# Repo metadata, CI, deployment
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.vercel
.claude

# Local secrets, recursive: a nested apps/web/.env must never reach the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# OS noise and logs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
